<BaseLayout title="How to Choose a JC Subject Combination | A-Worthy" description="The rules, university prerequisites and strategic choices behind a JC subject combination, for students entering JC 1 in 2027. From MOE, NUS and NTU." ogImage="/images/og-blog.png">
